      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm working on a documentary about the Algerian War of Independence. can u give me a timeline of the main events? but can u focus mostly on the perspective of the FLN and the locals fighting for independence? i want to capture what they were going through.",
      "source": "evaluator"
